    "article_summary": "The article describes a green, one-pot three-component synthesis of 3,4-disubstituted isoxazol-5(4H)-ones using aromatic aldehydes, ethyl acetoacetate, and hydroxylamine hydrochloride. The reaction utilizes a 50 wt% gluconic acid aqueous solution (GAAS) as both a recyclable reaction medium and a catalyst, achieving high yields (up to 94%) under mild conditions (70 \u00b0C).",
